# Build output — rebuilt by `pnpm build` / the package's own build script.
/lib/

# Promotional media: the README screenshots. Kept on disk because the README
# renders them, but this repo is a private self-use fork and does not carry its
# upstream's marketing surface in version control. `files` in package.json does
# not list `assets`, so they never enter the published tarball either.
/assets/

# Local packaging artifacts
*.tgz
